  "notable_quotes": [
    "The Hatz-based MOF is noninterpenetrated and uses a novel helical Zn-triazolate chain building unit, unlike related doubly interpenetrated pillar-layered analogues.",
    "Compound 1 shows high H2 uptake at 77 K and high C2H2 uptake near room temperature, indicating strong gas sorption performance.",
    "Compound 1 also has potential as a luminescent sensor for small aromatic molecules, including picric acid and p-xylene."
